description: Test catalog in git is canonical for case ids and TestRail export
globs: src/test/resources/test-cases/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Catalog source of truth

- Edit `src/test/resources/test-cases/*.json` only (not docs copy; run `./gradlew syncCatalogDocs` to mirror).
- Keep `@TmsLink` in tests aligned with catalog `id`.
- Set `automated_in` to `ClassName.methodName` for automated cases.
- Run `./gradlew validateCatalog` before committing catalog changes.
